representative_cards.original_text:
Mana cost: {2}{B}
Type: Sorcery
Mill five cards, then for each of those cards, a creature you control salvages that card unless an opponent pays 3 life. *(Exile it from your graveyard until that creature leaves the battlefield. Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, put a card it salvaged into your hand.)*

representative_cards.executable_text:
Mana cost: {2}{B}
Type: Sorcery
Mill five cards, then for each of those cards, Unless an opponent pays 3 life, do the following: Choose a creature you control; Exile that card from your graveyard until that creature leaves the battlefield; Maintain the salvaged collection with cards exiled this way: Whenever that creature deals combat damage to a player, choose a card in exile from the salvaged collection, then put it into its owner's hand.

